  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Domestic Shipping Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is designed to improve domestic and regional maritime transport connectivity by providing a new passenger/cargo ship to replace Manu Folau and upgrading safety of navigation in the outer islands and strengthen capacity in vessel operations, coordination and maintenance.</narrative>
  </description>
